---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
	title="About Poiema Retreats"
	description="The mission, purpose, and pastoral leadership behind Poiema Retreats — Ephesians 2:10."
>
	<div class="about-page">
		<header class="page-header">
			<div class="container">
				<span class="sub-heading">Our Mission & Identity</span>
				<h1 class="page-title">ABOUT POIEMA</h1>
				<p class="page-intro">
					“For we are His workmanship, created in Christ Jesus for good works, which God prepared beforehand that we should walk in them.” &mdash; Ephesians 2:10
				</p>
				<img class="opening-photo" src="/images/about-group.webp" alt="Poiema retreat attendees gathered beside the water" width="1800" height="497" fetchpriority="high" />
			</div>
		</header>

		<section class="section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="story-grid">
					<div class="fellowship-photos">
						<img src="/images/about-table.webp" alt="Retreat attendees sharing pizza around a table" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy" />
						<img src="/images/about-friends.webp" alt="Two friends wearing Poiema hats at a retreat" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy" />
					</div>
					<div class="story-content">
						<h2>What are we about?</h2>
						<p class="lead-paragraph">
							<strong>Poiema was launched out of a passion to see young adults encouraged in their walk with Christ and to see them operating as vital members of their local congregations.</strong>
						</p>
						<p>
							Often overlooked, too often not considered as important (until they are married) and sometimes limited in fellowshipping with peers due to the size of their church; Poiema was started to help yours and ours. And it seems to be working.
						</p>

						<h2>What is our Purpose?</h2>
						<p>
							The purpose of our retreats is to inform, encourage, and inspire Christian young adults regarding who they are in Christ. We see this as a life-awareness that is essential for everyone’s spiritual walk as well as the wellspring of joy and confidence.
						</p>
						<p>
							After all, we are God’s workmanship (<em>poiema</em>) and we want that to set in, be real to us, and when it does: worldview, apologetics, theology, vocation, and, well…all of life is set and in perspective.
						</p>

						<h2>Who are our Team leaders?</h2>
						<div class="team-grid">
							<div class="team-card">
								<img class="leader-photo" src="/images/about-laurence.webp" alt="Laurence Windham on a boat trip" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy" />
								<div class="team-card-header">
									<h3>Laurence Windham</h3>
									<span class="team-role">Pastor of Saint Peter Presbyterian Church</span>
								</div>
								<p>
									Laurence has worked with teenagers, collegians, and single adults ever since he began training and working in the ministry, which included serving as campus minister for Reformed University Fellowship at the University of Central Florida before he moved to Virginia.
								</p>
							</div>

							<div class="team-card">
								<img class="leader-photo" src="/images/about-david.webp" alt="David Cooper holding a lobster on a boat trip" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy" />
								<div class="team-card-header">
									<h3>David Cooper</h3>
									<span class="team-role">Elder at Providence Church in Lynchburg, Virginia</span>
								</div>
								<p>
									David serves as an elder at Providence Church in Lynchburg Virginia. He is a graduate of Liberty University and has worked with young adults for years. He has been a welcome addition to teaching and leading devotions as well as busting dance moves at our retreats.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<h2>Church Oversight & Doctrine</h2>
						<p>
							Poiema Retreats is a ministry of <strong>Saint Peter Presbyterian Church</strong> in Bristol, Virginia. All registrations and donations are received by our church treasurer and overseen by our diaconate.
						</p>
					</div>

					<aside class="pillars-sidebar">
						<div class="pillar-box">
							<h3>The Rhythm of Poiema</h3>
							<ul class="pillars-list">
								<li>
									<strong>Encouragement</strong>
									<span>Woven into every activity, prayer, and conversation (Romans 1:12).</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<strong>Communication</strong>
									<span>Interactive lectures with open discussions so truth is clearly delivered.</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<strong>Joy in Fellowship</strong>
									<span>The joy of the Lord in every aspect—from dining to dancing to discussion.</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<strong>Life Together</strong>
									<span>Transparency, humility, openness, looking on the interests of others.</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="sidebar-cta">
							<h3>Join Us at Our Next Gathering</h3>
							<p>Explore upcoming conference dates and secure your spot.</p>
							<a href="/retreats" class="btn btn-primary cta-btn">Explore Retreats &rarr;</a>
						</div>
					</aside>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Base>

<style>
	.opening-photo { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 32px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
	.fellowship-photos { grid-area: photos; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
	.story-content { grid-area: story; }
	.pillars-sidebar { grid-area: sidebar; }
	.fellowship-photos img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: var(--radius-md); }
	.leader-photo { width: 160px; height: auto; float: left; margin: 0 24px 12px 0; border-radius: var(--radius-md); }
	.team-card { display: flow-root; }
	@media (max-width: 520px) { .leader-photo { float: none; width: 100%; max-height: 360px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 60%; margin: 0 0 20px; } }
	.container {
		max-width: var(--wide-width);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 var(--spacing-xl);
	}

	.page-header {
		padding: var(--spacing-4xl) 0 var(--spacing-3xl);
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.sub-heading {
		font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
	}

	.page-title {
		font-size: var(--font-size-4xl);
		margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md);
		color: var(--color-text-main);
	}

	.page-intro {
		max-width: 680px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-style: italic;
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
	}

	.section {
		padding: var(--spacing-4xl) 0 var(--spacing-5xl);
	}

	.story-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr;
		grid-template-areas: "story photos" "story sidebar";
		grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
		gap: 32px var(--spacing-4xl);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.story-content h2 {
		font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
		margin: var(--spacing-2xl) 0 var(--spacing-md);
		color: var(--color-text-main);
	}

	.story-content h2:first-child {
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	.lead-paragraph {
		font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-main);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.story-content p {
		font-size: var(--font-size-base);
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
	}

	/* Team Grid */
	.team-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: var(--spacing-lg);
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
	}

	.team-card {
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-left: 3px solid var(--color-brand);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		padding: var(--spacing-lg);
	}

	.team-card-header h3 {
		font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
		margin: 0 0 4px;
		color: var(--color-text-main);
	}

	.team-role {
		display: block;
		font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
	}

	.team-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	/* Pillars Sidebar */
	.pillars-sidebar {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--spacing-xl);
	}

	.pillar-box {
		background: var(--color-surface-soft);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		padding: var(--spacing-xl);
	}

	.pillar-box h3 {
		font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
		margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-main);
		padding-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.pillars-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.pillars-list li {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2px;
	}

	.pillars-list strong {
		font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-main);
	}

	.pillars-list span {
		font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.sidebar-cta {
		background: linear-gradient(
			135deg,
			color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 10%, var(--color-surface)),
			var(--color-surface)
		);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		padding: var(--spacing-xl);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.sidebar-cta h3 {
		font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
		margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-xs);
		color: var(--color-text-main);
	}

	.sidebar-cta p {
		font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.cta-btn {
		width: 100%;
		display: block;
	}

	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.story-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			grid-template-areas: "photos" "story" "sidebar";
		}
	}
</style>
